# Agent collab

When the user mentions DeepSeek, the architecture backlog, or “collab mailbox”, read `docs/collab/HANDOFF.md` first.

- Shared files: `docs/collab/`. Protocol: `docs/collab/README.md`.
- Docs turns: `PROMPT_DEEPSEEK.md` / `PROMPT_DEEPSEEK_NEXT.md`. Code turns: `PROMPT_DEEPSEEK_CODE.md`. Your job: `PROMPT_CURSOR.md`.
- Only the **Turn** agent in `HANDOFF.md` edits `BACKLOG.md`.
- After a code drop: review the diff, run typecheck/tests, mark the slice done or send DeepSeek back.
- Do not merge `docs/SUGGESTIONS_AND_IMPROVEMENTS.md` into the backlog.
- Tell the user the one sentence to paste into DeepSeek.
